      "id": "gbrc-aviti24-platform",
      "group": "GBRC",
      "title": "Element AVITI24 Platform",
      "gist": "The GBRC's benchtop short-read sequencer — Illumina-compatible, with flexible output levels and dual flow cells.",
      "source": "GBRC portal — Services",
