      "body": "The GBRC provides computational analysis and custom consultation, from quality control to publication-ready figures. Analysis can be bundled with data delivery: when your sequencing completes, the bioinformatics team can provide standard or custom analysis pipelines.\n\n## Standard analysis\n\n- Quality control\n- Alignment\n- Variant calling\n- Differential expression\n\n## Custom consultation\n\nProject-specific bioinformatics pipelines and analysis, developed with you for your research questions.\n\n## Training\n\nHands-on bioinformatics training for researchers.\n\nPricing and requests run through the [GBRC iLab portal](https://my.ilabsolutions.com/service_center/3232/?tab=services)."
