      "last_updated": "2026-08-13",
      "body": "The GBRC offers **free consultations** for all prospective and current users. During a consultation, the team can help with:\n\n- Experimental design and technology selection\n- Sample preparation and submission requirements\n- Bioinformatics analysis planning\n- Budget estimation and timeline planning\n- Grant proposal support for genomics aims\n\n## How to schedule\n\nEmail [gbrc@uidaho.edu](mailto:gbrc@uidaho.edu) to set up a time.\n\n- **Hours:** Monday–Friday, 8:00 AM–5:00 PM Pacific\n- **Location:** IRIC 210, 685 S. Line Street, Moscow, Idaho 83844"
