      "last_updated": "2026-08-13",
      "body": "## Data retention\n\nRaw sequencing data is retained for **one year** from the date of generation. Download your data promptly. Extended storage can be arranged upon request.\n\n## Data access\n\nData access is restricted to the **submitting lab** until all associated charges have been settled. Contact [gbrc@uidaho.edu](mailto:gbrc@uidaho.edu) if you need to share data with collaborators."
