      "body": "If GBRC services contributed to your research, include the following acknowledgment in your publications:\n\n```\nData collection and analyses performed by the University of Idaho IIDS Genomics and Bioinformatics Resource Core Facility, RRID:SCR_026416\n```\n\nThe core's identifier is `RRID:SCR_026416`."
