      "body": "The Vandalizer, front to back: what the platform is, how to get in, and how tasks, workflows, and projects fit together — with the security model, and the self-hosting path for institutions.\n\n## What it is\n\n{{kb: iids-vandalizer-overview}}\n\n## Get access\n\n{{kb: iids-vandalizer-access}}\n\n## The building blocks\n\nEverything the Vandalizer does starts as a task.\n\n{{kb: iids-vandalizer-tasks}}\n\n## Put them together\n\n{{kb: iids-vandalizer-workflows}}\n\n## Work in projects\n\n{{kb: iids-vandalizer-projects-chat}}\n\n## Trust and safety\n\n{{kb: iids-vandalizer-security}}\n\n## For your institution\n\nDeploying the Community Edition is a job for IT and data staff — pass this section along.\n\n{{kb: iids-vandalizer-self-hosting}}"
