      "body": "Submitting through IIDS, or using IIDS resources in a sponsored project? These entries take you from first contact to submission.\n\n## Start here\n\n{{kb: iids-submitting-a-proposal}}\n\n{{kb: iids-proposal-submission-criteria}}\n\n{{kb: iids-proposal-support-services}}\n\n## Declare IIDS affiliation\n\nAffiliation is declared at submission — it cannot be added to an active award later.\n\n{{kb: iids-veras-institute-affiliation}}\n\n{{kb: iids-policy-affiliation-requirement}}\n\n{{kb: iids-policy-fa-split}}\n\n## Budget IIDS services\n\n{{kb: iids-policy-subsidized-services}}\n\n{{kb: rcds-service-center-rates}}\n\n## Strengthen the proposal\n\n{{kb: rcds-research-data-management}}\n\n{{kb: rcds-proposal-support}}\n\n{{kb: rcds-external-computing-resources}}"
