      "body": "Which machine should run your job, where should the data sit, and what does it cost? These entries map the RCDS systems and the ways to use them, from a free account to owning your own nodes.\n\n## The systems\n\n{{kb: rcds-compute-hardware}}\n\n{{kb: rcds-standalone-servers}}\n\n## Where data lives\n\n{{kb: rcds-storage-systems}}\n\n{{kb: rcds-storage-acceptable-use}}\n\n## Ways to buy in\n\nA free account covers most needs — these are the paths for when it doesn't.\n\n{{kb: rcds-condo-service}}\n\n{{kb: rcds-umbrella-pui}}\n\n{{kb: rcds-service-center-rates}}\n\n## Beyond compute\n\n{{kb: rcds-hosting-service}}\n\n{{kb: rcds-development-services}}\n\n{{kb: rcds-workshops}}\n\n## Where to go next\n\n{{kb: rcds-guide-running-jobs}}\n\n{{kb: rcds-guide-moving-and-storing-data}}"
