      "last_updated": "2026-07-18",
      "body": "[SAMStat](http://samstat.sourceforge.net/) is a C program which will generate\na report with a variety of statistics on quality, read length, mapping, etc.\nThe report is HTML5 formatted. It supports sam, bam, fasta, and fastq files.\n\nThis application is in the GRC module\n\n```\nmodule load grc\n```\n\nUsage is simple:\n\n```\nsamstat file.bam\n```\n\nIt also supports wild-cards and will produce a different report for each\nmatching file:\n\n```\nsamstat *.bam\n```"
